author: claude-orchestrator
acceptance_criteria: pm-github-sync.yml pins 2026.10.16 at 67a5e3e; pm-github-closeout.yml calls the reusable closeout workflow at the same pin
resolution: "Reverified main ca7e188bc91e (unchanged since audit): Both .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml and pm-github-closeout.yml pin 67a5e3e / 2026.10.16. Adoption is delivered; this does not claim scheduled jobs are currently green. Retained evidence: .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml, .github/workflows/pm-github-closeout.yml."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T12:41:01.088Z",claude-orchestrator,"CI on the wave PR failed in test/workflow-security.test.ts and test/workflow-update-automation.test.ts: the pin policy only recognised pm-github's reusable sync workflow, so the new pm-github-closeout.yml caller was treated as an untrusted action owner. The policy now lists both canonical reusable workflows, each bound to its dedicated caller file and job (pm-github-sync.yml/gated-sync, pm-github-closeout.yml/gated-closeout), with the same full-SHA pin and pm-github release/version match. Local: workflow-security 6/6, workflow-update-automation passing."
close_reason: "Reverified main ca7e188bc91e (unchanged since audit): Both .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml and pm-github-closeout.yml pin 67a5e3e / 2026.10.16. Adoption is delivered; this does not claim scheduled jobs are currently green. Retained evidence: .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml, .github/workflows/pm-github-closeout.yml."
